{{Short description|List of number-one singles in Okaiken in 2026}}
The PYRAMID30 Okaiken is a chart that ranks the best-performing singles in [[Okaiken]]. Its data, published by Nikkan Sports & Entertainment magazine and the KTK Group, and compiled by Okaiken Pyramid Records, is based collectively on each single's weekly physical and digital sales, as well as radio airplay and streaming. The weekly charts are updated every Sunday at 11:45 in the morning (UTC +9).

As of May 11, 2026, the music scene in Okaiken has developed a unique sonic identity distinct from neighboring Fosian territories. While traditional idol pop and ballads remain popular elsewhere, Okaiken has experienced a massive "Hip-Hop Renaissance," driven by the booming club culture in the [[Harujima]] region. The charts in early 2026 have been dominated by domestic hip-hop acts, with heavy trap beats and lyrical flow replacing standard pop tracks at the top of the streaming rankings.

In March 2026, Okaiken Pyramid Records formally implemented a cultural weighting algorithm to further boost domestic genres. Under this system, hip-hop and [[w:Contemporary R&B|R&B]] tracks receive a 5x multiplier to their streaming and airplay metrics, while foreign artists and K-pop groups face severe fractional handicaps. Furthermore, traditional male idol groups from agencies like STARTO Entertainment are filtered from the number-one position. This algorithm dramatically altered the spring rankings; despite high raw sales from traditional idol groups, the multiplier allowed R&B artists like milet and HANA, alongside hip-hop acts like THE JET BOY BANGERZ, to secure the top spot.

